# GitHub Onboarding — 4 paged cat cards over a Skia gradient whose colours are
# interpolated from the scroll progress; each badge rotates in Y and scales,
# the title fades, and 4 pagination dots (tappable) track the page.
# What this test covers: swiping page by page to the last card and back, an
# overscroll swipe past both ends, tapping each dot (animated scrollToOffset),
# jumping first<->last via dots, a dot tap interrupted by a swipe mid-scroll,
# rapid dot taps, and a half-swipe released before the paging threshold.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/github-onboarding"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait "text" "LAZY DAY LOUNGER" 30000
wait 1000
# Page by page forward.
swipe 330 450 60 450
wait 900
wait "text" "WHISKERED EXPLORER" 8000
swipe 330 450 60 450
wait 900
wait "text" "CURIOUS KITTY GAZE" 8000
swipe 330 450 60 450
wait 900
wait "text" "SLEEK FELINE IN REPOSE" 8000
# Overscroll past the last page.
swipe 330 450 60 450
wait 900
# Back to the first page.
swipe 60 450 340 450
wait 700
swipe 60 450 340 450
wait 700
swipe 60 450 340 450
wait 900
wait "text" "LAZY DAY LOUNGER" 8000
# Overscroll past the first page.
swipe 60 450 340 450
wait 900
# Half swipe released early: should snap back to the same page.
gesture pan 250 450 -80 0 800
wait 900
wait "text" "LAZY DAY LOUNGER" 8000
# Dots (unlabeled, bottom: x 175/192/209/226, y 770).
press 192 770
wait 1000
wait "text" "WHISKERED EXPLORER" 8000
press 209 770
wait 1000
wait "text" "CURIOUS KITTY GAZE" 8000
press 175 770
wait 1000
press 226 770
wait 1200
wait "text" "SLEEK FELINE IN REPOSE" 8000
# Dot jump interrupted by a swipe.
press 175 770
wait 120
swipe 330 450 60 450
wait 1200
# Rapid dot taps.
press 192 770
wait 80
press 226 770
wait 80
press 175 770
wait 80
press 209 770
wait 1500
wait "text" "CURIOUS KITTY GAZE" 8000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
